              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Niiva mundu aladuya mutugwa weve musaza anoho mukali mumoni ma agotizi emoni yeeye, alamulakuula ave umuvoholore gave kuli mutungu gwemoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.26",
